{"version":1,"content":"<p>路透社報道，菲律賓外交部今天（周一）召見中國駐菲律賓大使，就中國大使發表的一份聲明向馬尼拉方面表達了「嚴重關切和強烈反對」。</p><p>菲律賓方面稱，該聲明傳遞了使用武力的威脅訊息。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T07:19:14.679215+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:42:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T07:37:37.571258+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T07:17:39.540755+00:00","content_hash":"6e0e03dba498184082c519d1361914a36847f0762b3654d9d8117401da1695e8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}